    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veg Uprising</strong> is a real-time tactical stealth strategy game where you lead a squad of unstable vegetables through enemy-infested garden battlefields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.poster.avif?t=1754640453\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.webm?t=1754640453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.mp4?t=1754640453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a handcrafted tactical scenario. You\u2019ll sneak past patrolling weeds, crouch to stay hidden, use elevation to your advantage, and coordinate your squad to free captured allies or take out boss enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth is essential</strong>: crouching hides you from sight, but standing up makes noise that enemies can hear. You can\u2019t attack unless you\u2019re on the same ground level as your target, but enemies can hit you from above \u2014 so picking your position is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/36d9a867940beb40cd039857cc27bc27.avif?t=1754640453\" width=800 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you unlock playable characters, each with their own movement quirks and combat personality. Before each mission, you assign loadout items to each character \u2014 traps, distractions, tools. Every decision has consequences, and the wrong combo can cost you the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the shop offers no in-game advantages, you can unlock plenty of cosmetic flair \u2014 ridiculous outfits, stylish accessories, and vegetable fashion that absolutely won\u2019t help you win. But at least you\u2019ll look good while you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/9870caa6ca133429225f4ab1fb6dbebd.avif?t=1754640453\" width=800 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Veg Uprising is a mix of tight tactical design, stealth-focused gameplay, and character-driven comedy. It\u2019s loud, weird, strategic, and nothing like your average garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veg Uprising</strong> is a real-time tactical stealth strategy game where you lead a squad of unstable vegetables through enemy-infested garden battlefields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.poster.avif?t=1754640453\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.webm?t=1754640453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/0d6ae8075b036802fa3d6b48c9475610.mp4?t=1754640453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a handcrafted tactical scenario. You\u2019ll sneak past patrolling weeds, crouch to stay hidden, use elevation to your advantage, and coordinate your squad to free captured allies or take out boss enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth is essential</strong>: crouching hides you from sight, but standing up makes noise that enemies can hear. You can\u2019t attack unless you\u2019re on the same ground level as your target, but enemies can hit you from above \u2014 so picking your position is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/36d9a867940beb40cd039857cc27bc27.avif?t=1754640453\" width=800 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you unlock playable characters, each with their own movement quirks and combat personality. Before each mission, you assign loadout items to each character \u2014 traps, distractions, tools. Every decision has consequences, and the wrong combo can cost you the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the shop offers no in-game advantages, you can unlock plenty of cosmetic flair \u2014 ridiculous outfits, stylish accessories, and vegetable fashion that absolutely won\u2019t help you win. But at least you\u2019ll look good while you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853570/extras/9870caa6ca133429225f4ab1fb6dbebd.avif?t=1754640453\" width=800 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Veg Uprising is a mix of tight tactical design, stealth-focused gameplay, and character-driven comedy. It\u2019s loud, weird, strategic, and nothing like your average garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
